fix: filter artist_sources by enabled servers and use positional Plex search

- Filter artist_sources in fetch_albums_for_artist against get_enabled_server_ids so stale multi-server sources in Redis do not trigger connections to unchecked servers (alpha, NAS, plexcu, svenghali, RogNAS).
- Update search_music_on_server to use positional query search (music_lib.search(query)) so artists like Billy Strings return from remote shared Plex libraries.
